---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title:
description: 記錄軟體開發、AI 協作與把想法做成作品的過程。
permalink: /
---
<section class="hero shell">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Independent developer journal · Taipei</p>
    <h1>把想法，寫成<br><em>可以被找到</em>的作品。</h1>
    <p class="hero-summary">
      關於軟體、AI 與獨立創作的實作筆記。這裡不追逐速成答案，
      只留下可重現的過程，以及值得帶走的判斷。
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="#latest-post">閱讀最新文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-note" aria-label="本期資訊">
    <span class="note-index">NO. 001</span>
    <div class="note-orbit" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>Build</span>
      <span>Learn</span>
      <span>Share</span>
    </div>
    <p>First edition</p>
    <strong>2026 / 07</strong>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="latest shell" id="latest-post" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Latest writing</p>
      <h2 id="latest-title">最新文章</h2>
    </div>
    <p>{{ collections.posts | length }} 篇公開筆記</p>
  </div>

  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <article class="post-card">
        <div class="post-card-number" aria-hidden="true">0{{ loop.index }}</div>
        <div class="post-card-content">
          <div class="post-card-meta">
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
            <span>{{ post.data.readingTime }} 分鐘閱讀</span>
          </div>
          <h3><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          <ul class="tag-list">
            {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
              {% if tag != "post" %}<li>{{ tag }}</li>{% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a class="card-arrow" href="{{ post.url | url }}" aria-label="閱讀〈{{ post.data.title }}〉">↗</a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="manifesto">
  <div class="shell manifesto-grid">
    <p class="eyebrow">A small manifesto</p>
    <blockquote>
      「好的筆記不是結論的倉庫，<br>
      而是讓下一次行動更清楚的<span>路標</span>。」
    </blockquote>
    <p class="manifesto-note">
      本站使用開放原始碼工具製作，不放廣告、不追蹤瀏覽行為，
      讓閱讀回到文字本身。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

